  "htmlPage": {
    "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/records/areas-of-effect/sphere/"
  },
  "rulesText": "A Sphere is an area of effect that extends in straight lines from a point of origin outward in all directions. The effect that creates a Sphere specifies the distance it extends as the radius of the Sphere.\n\nA Sphere's point of origin is included in the Sphere's area of effect."
}
